# =============================================================================
# .vercelignore — Vercel Deploy Exclusions
# =============================================================================
# IMPORTANT: Folders served via vercel.json rewrites/redirects MUST NOT be
# listed here. Adding a served folder will cause 404 in production.
#
# Currently served folders (DO NOT IGNORE):
#   - EI/                 (root: gswp.com.br)
#   - reserva-jp/         (subdomain: reservajp.gswp.com.br)
#   - jubiaba/            (route: /jubiaba)
#   - Ancestra/           (route: /ancestra)
#   - Fotos Zanuto/       (assets for reserva-jp)
# =============================================================================

# Build artifacts
node_modules/
electron/
build/
dist/
supabase/

# Dev tooling / framework
.aiox-core/
.antigravity/
# .claude/ ignorado, EXCETO skills (usadas pelo prompt-builder /api/generate)
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.github/

# Original/backup folders (NOT served)
Fotos Zanuto-ORIGINAL/

# Archives
Livros.rar
*.rar
*.zip

# Heavy media — block ALL por padrão
*.pdf
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv

# Re-incluir apenas PDFs pequenos que são realmente servidos
!Fotos Zanuto/Masterplan - KV.pdf
!jubiaba/masterplan-kv-deck.pdf
!jubiaba/masterplan-kv-v2.pdf
!jubiaba/Investidores SERGIPE/**/*.pdf
!Ancestra/**/*.pdf
!reserva-jp/**/*.pdf

# Re-incluir vídeos servidos (todos são pequenos, < 100MB)
!Fotos Zanuto/videos/*.mp4
!jubiaba/**/*.mp4
!reserva-jp/**/*.mp4
!Ancestra/**/*.mp4
